## Quick Start

```bash
chmod +x deploy.sh
./deploy.sh
```

## Manual Installation

For each component, apply the manifests in order:

{{- range .Components }}

### {{ .Name }}

```bash
oc apply -f {{ .Name }}/namespace.yaml
{{- if .HasOperatorGroup }}
oc apply -f {{ .Name }}/operatorgroup.yaml
{{- end }}
oc apply -f {{ .Name }}/subscription.yaml

# Wait for operator to be ready
oc wait csv -n {{ .InstallNamespace }} \
  -l operators.coreos.com/{{ .Package }}.{{ .InstallNamespace }}="" \
  --for=jsonpath='{.status.phase}'=Succeeded \
  --timeout=300s
{{- if .HasCustomResources }}

# Apply custom resources
oc apply -f {{ .Name }}/custom-resources/
{{- end }}
```
{{- end }}

